1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:22,500
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

2
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:23,519
Let's go!

3
00:00:23,519 --> 00:00:26,500
This world is flooded with colors.

4
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:29,560
Truth and lies cloud our eyes.

5
00:00:29,560 --> 00:00:32,580
Use your heart and truly see.

6
00:00:32,580 --> 00:00:35,560
The truth is not far away.

7
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:38,579
Hey you good or bad, truth and lies—

8
00:00:38,579 --> 00:00:41,579
no escaping the gray smoke in your mind.

9
00:00:41,579 --> 00:00:44,560
Bring all the courage you have,

10
00:00:44,560 --> 00:00:47,600
and maybe you can save this world.

11
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:49,920
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

12
00:00:49,920 --> 00:00:53,300
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

13
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:56,280
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

14
00:00:56,280 --> 00:00:57,520
Mojo Spy

15
00:00:59,560 --> 00:01:13,200
Dr. Breeze, who had been working with the inspectors,

16
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:15,879
was actually his younger brother Storm in disguise.

17
00:01:15,879 --> 00:01:19,560
He led everyone into a pre-set trap.

18
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:24,820
Yet Storm himself was struck by Dorothy

19
00:01:24,820 --> 00:01:25,900
and turned into amber.

20
00:01:26,019 --> 00:01:33,599
As Dorothy closed in, Tantalus Gun in hand,

21
00:01:33,599 --> 00:01:37,079
what else could the group do?

22
00:01:37,079 --> 00:01:41,920
Spring breeze turns to rain.

23
00:01:41,920 --> 00:01:47,679
Thanks to this ugly, talkative fool,

24
00:01:47,679 --> 00:01:50,120
I finally had the chance to catch you,

25
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:52,840
you pests hindering the revival of The Illumin-Eye!

26
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:57,100
Though a few of the vermin are still absent,

27
00:01:57,100 --> 00:01:58,760
which does make me feel somewhat regretful,

28
00:01:58,760 --> 00:02:02,680
I'm certain we'll fill their places soon.

29
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:05,439
So for the time that remains,

30
00:02:05,439 --> 00:02:08,920
I'll help you all shed your ugly mortal husks

31
00:02:08,920 --> 00:02:12,140
and turn into gorgeous amber.

32
00:02:12,140 --> 00:02:13,120
Wait!

33
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:18,360
Any last words, Detective Chen?

34
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:21,080
The Tantalus Pendant is the secret of the Storm family.

35
00:02:21,080 --> 00:02:23,000
Can you tell me

36
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:25,260
how you knew how to use it?

37
00:02:25,260 --> 00:02:26,719
A secret?

38
00:02:30,699 --> 00:02:31,920
As long as people like Storm exist in this world,

39
00:02:31,920 --> 00:02:33,760
what secrets could there be?

40
00:02:33,760 --> 00:02:38,040
This despicable poacher,

41
00:02:38,040 --> 00:02:41,240
while poaching the beautiful pets of the Lord of the Illumin-Eye,

42
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:42,760
was caught red-handed by me.

43
00:02:42,760 --> 00:02:45,980
When I brought him before the Lord,

44
00:02:45,980 --> 00:02:47,700
before we could even speak,

45
00:02:47,700 --> 00:02:49,800
he was already trembling and begging for mercy.

46
00:02:49,879 --> 00:02:53,659
He even volunteered the secret of the Tantalus Pendant,

47
00:02:53,659 --> 00:02:54,859
and offered up the pendant,

48
00:02:54,859 --> 00:02:56,979
begging us to spare his worthless life.

49
00:02:56,979 --> 00:02:59,379
Later, the all-knowing, all-powerful Lord Eye

50
00:02:59,379 --> 00:03:02,019
not only didn't punish this shameless poacher,

51
00:03:02,019 --> 00:03:05,519
He was actually made our partner.

52
00:03:05,519 --> 00:03:07,919
Back then, I couldn't stand it.

53
00:03:07,919 --> 00:03:09,560
But only now

54
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:12,460
do I understand Lord Eye's good intentions.

55
00:03:17,680 --> 00:03:18,919
So that's how it is.

56
00:03:18,920 --> 00:03:22,420
If Dr. Breeze learns his family's secret—

57
00:03:22,420 --> 00:03:24,400
that his younger brother sold him out so easily—

58
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:27,020
he'll be really disappointed.

59
00:03:27,020 --> 00:03:28,980
The way you talk,

60
00:03:28,980 --> 00:03:31,220
from the very beginning,

61
00:03:31,220 --> 00:03:33,280
we've fallen into your trap.

62
00:03:35,300 --> 00:03:36,320
Fine.

63
00:03:36,320 --> 00:03:38,680
Before you become works of art,

64
00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:41,160
I'll tell you everything.

65
00:03:41,160 --> 00:03:42,740
Hawxing,

66
00:03:42,740 --> 00:03:44,880
that email you intercepted earlier

67
00:03:44,880 --> 00:03:47,080
was bait to hook you.

68
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:49,380
The golden monkey that turned to amber

69
00:03:49,380 --> 00:03:51,980
was likewise a deliberate setup

70
00:03:51,980 --> 00:03:53,340
to lure you into the trap.

71
00:03:53,340 --> 00:03:54,540
Then,

72
00:03:54,540 --> 00:03:57,939
I lured you all to Whitewater Pond

73
00:03:57,939 --> 00:04:00,820
and had Storm sneak into the base

74
00:04:00,820 --> 00:04:03,700
to seize the other half of the Tantalus Pendant.

75
00:04:03,700 --> 00:04:07,280
Storm would get the silver necklace.

76
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:09,340
Out the window with the golden monkey!

77
00:04:09,340 --> 00:04:10,080
Then

78
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:11,560
he followed my instructions

79
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:13,720
and disguised himself as Dr. Breeze.

80
00:04:13,720 --> 00:04:15,900
Outside the window, I caught both items.

81
00:04:16,019 --> 00:04:19,699
Then I flew straight to the lakeside and waited quietly for your arrival.

82
00:04:19,699 --> 00:04:21,339
My dear little puppet,

83
00:04:21,339 --> 00:04:24,819
I realized long ago that you’re a perfect opponent.

84
00:04:24,819 --> 00:04:29,859
So I carefully orchestrated this performance just for you.

85
00:04:29,859 --> 00:04:32,799
At first I thought you’d come alone.

86
00:04:32,799 --> 00:04:37,079
But unexpectedly, you brought all the actors I needed.

87
00:04:37,079 --> 00:04:40,139
What a well-behaved little puppet you are.

88
00:04:40,139 --> 00:04:42,939
Alright,

89
00:04:42,939 --> 00:04:45,259
since every mystery is now solved,

90
00:04:45,259 --> 00:04:48,579
it’s time for this performance to take its final bow.

91
00:04:48,579 --> 00:04:51,060
Would all actors please strike your most satisfying pose?

92
00:04:51,060 --> 00:04:53,360
Get ready to become beautiful amber!

93
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:56,319
Hawxing!

94
00:04:56,319 --> 00:05:00,539
As expected of the puppet I value most.

95
00:05:00,539 --> 00:05:03,879
Even in the face of danger, you advance bravely without a trace of fear.

96
00:05:03,879 --> 00:05:07,579
I will turn you into the most magnificent work of art.

97
00:05:07,579 --> 00:05:09,079
Sorry,

98
00:05:09,079 --> 00:05:11,199
but I don’t know what fear is.

99
00:05:11,199 --> 00:05:12,819
And I’m not a puppet.

100
00:05:12,819 --> 00:05:16,620
Besides, this performance isn’t over yet.

101
00:05:16,620 --> 00:05:21,800
Stop!

102
00:05:21,800 --> 00:05:23,019
You puppet!

103
00:05:23,019 --> 00:05:25,259
You have no right to choose!

104
00:05:32,959 --> 00:05:34,420
You really surprised me.

105
00:05:34,420 --> 00:05:34,959
Hawxing.

106
00:05:34,959 --> 00:05:38,420
You truly are my most admired puppet.

107
00:05:38,420 --> 00:05:42,560
To think you'd face perfect me head-on.

108
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:46,000
This truly excites me!

109
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:49,000
Show me what you've got. Entertain me!

110
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:55,660
Alert! Alert!

111
00:05:55,660 --> 00:05:57,439
External impact too strong!

112
00:05:57,439 --> 00:05:59,540
Shield energy depleting rapidly!

113
00:05:59,540 --> 00:06:01,860
Failure expected in 30 seconds.

114
00:06:01,860 --> 00:06:03,660
Use reserve energy.

115
00:06:03,660 --> 00:06:05,100
Insufficient energy.

116
00:06:05,100 --> 00:06:06,860
Command cannot be carried out.

117
00:06:06,860 --> 00:06:09,860
Repeat: Command cannot be carried out.

118
00:06:23,860 --> 00:06:24,860
Are you two okay?

119
00:06:26,860 --> 00:06:28,860
I'm fine. But that guy—

120
00:06:31,860 --> 00:06:33,860
I hate people interrupting my art!

121
00:06:34,860 --> 00:06:35,860
Prepare to die!

122
00:06:46,899 --> 00:06:47,460
Hands up!

123
00:06:47,460 --> 00:06:49,620
You're surrounded!

124
00:06:49,620 --> 00:06:51,120
You... all of you!

125
00:06:51,120 --> 00:06:53,740
Damn it! Damn it!

126
00:06:53,740 --> 00:06:56,720
Why, why?!

127
00:06:56,720 --> 00:07:00,819
Why must the most perfect ending, in the end,

128
00:07:00,819 --> 00:07:01,900
Always be ruined by you

129
00:07:01,900 --> 00:07:03,800
Stupid, ugly maggots?

130
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:06,520
Watch out!

131
00:07:13,500 --> 00:07:14,900
What's that little monkey—

132
00:07:14,900 --> 00:07:18,319
Damn, it's a smoke bomb!

133
00:07:18,319 --> 00:07:20,960
You damn maggots!

134
00:07:20,960 --> 00:07:22,960
Don't gloat too soon.

135
00:07:22,960 --> 00:07:24,920
The Illumin-Eye's final ritual

136
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:26,500
Is about to begin.

137
00:07:26,500 --> 00:07:28,600
The world will be washed clean,

138
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:29,980
And you maggots

139
00:07:29,980 --> 00:07:32,220
Will be buried at the bottom of the sea forever.

140
00:07:32,220 --> 00:07:39,120
How could I let you slip away again?

141
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:41,880
Dis—disappeared!

142
00:07:50,899 --> 00:07:52,800
Damn it, he got away again!

143
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:55,000
Thanks to you guys arriving in time,

144
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:56,880
Otherwise, we'd have been done for.

145
00:07:56,880 --> 00:08:00,399
Looks like this time wasn't all for nothing.

146
00:08:21,500 --> 00:08:22,019
Dr. Breeze,

147
00:08:22,019 --> 00:08:24,199
This is the combined Tantalus Pendant.

148
00:08:24,199 --> 00:08:26,199
Now I'm returning it to you.

149
00:08:26,199 --> 00:08:27,779
As for your brother...

150
00:08:27,779 --> 00:08:29,859
I'm sorry.

151
00:08:29,860 --> 00:08:35,759
No. Storm brought this on himself.

152
00:08:35,759 --> 00:08:38,440
If we have to blame someone,

153
00:08:38,440 --> 00:08:43,919
then blame only me, his big brother, who cared too little back then.

154
00:08:43,919 --> 00:08:47,659
Doctor, don't be too upset.

155
00:08:47,659 --> 00:08:49,820
Your little brother is still alive, in theory.

156
00:08:49,820 --> 00:08:57,120
Officer Han, are you still going to take my little brother away?

157
00:08:57,120 --> 00:09:00,940
Yes. Please understand.

158
00:09:00,940 --> 00:09:03,240
I'm going to solve the mystery of the falling stone.

159
00:09:03,240 --> 00:09:06,200
I believe the final outcome of that myth

160
00:09:06,200 --> 00:09:07,759
can definitely be changed.

161
00:09:07,759 --> 00:09:09,179
I will save my little brother!

162
00:09:09,179 --> 00:09:10,600
All right.

163
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:12,620
I'll report your request to my superiors.

164
00:09:12,620 --> 00:09:14,379
Thank you.

165
00:09:14,379 --> 00:09:23,320
Storm, trust your big brother.

166
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:25,759
This time, I'll definitely bring you back.

167
00:09:57,120 --> 00:10:01,259
Waving to me from the horizon,

168
00:10:01,259 --> 00:10:04,919
each day is just sunrise and sunset,

169
00:10:04,919 --> 00:10:08,899
turning through time, I dream of more,

170
00:10:08,899 --> 00:10:13,940
looking forward to every second and every moment of life.

171
00:10:13,940 --> 00:10:20,659
My bright eyes are gleaming.

172
00:10:20,659 --> 00:10:24,019
My smile faces the sunlight.

173
00:10:24,019 --> 00:10:29,279
I tread softly at this silent crossroads.

174
00:10:29,279 --> 00:10:37,539
All the offerings to open the Gate of Civilization

175
00:10:37,539 --> 00:10:41,620
have finally been gathered.

176
00:10:41,620 --> 00:10:44,419
The Illumin-Eye's real hideout

177
00:10:44,419 --> 00:10:47,439
is hidden in some supermarket in Tuna Town.

178
00:10:47,439 --> 00:10:50,199
It's you!

179
00:10:50,199 --> 00:10:51,840
So you're actually here!

180
00:10:51,840 --> 00:10:54,040
The Illumin-Eye!

181
00:10:54,040 --> 00:10:55,680
Surrender to us right now!

182
00:10:55,680 --> 00:10:58,080
Today is the end of you villains!